d/Remote Work Resources Office of the Provost Baylor Round Table Ignite Great Colleges to Work For® Survey Human Resources Careers & Opportunities New Faculty and Staff New Employee Forms Research & Learn Apply & Interview New Faculty and Staff Welcome & Orientation Steps for New Faculty Steps for New Staff New Employee Forms Completing Your I-9 Employment Forms by State Transition & Exit Contingent Workers (Auxiliaries) Other Campus Employment Visa Sponsorship and Support Additional Resources New Employee Forms In This Guide New Employee Forms Information about each Form I-9 W-4 Request for Deposit of Payroll Earnings Electronic W-2 Form Election Self Identification Disclosure Payroll Deduction Authorization Memorandum of Understanding Copies of Unofficial Transcripts Resources New Employee Forms To view and complete some of these forms, you need access to Ignite as well as Adobe Acrobat Reader software on your computer. To download a free copy of Adobe Acrobat Reader click here. Most forms are available online inside Ignite . However, a few are PDF forms that you will submit. If you have questions regarding any of the forms, you will have a chance to ask them during Called to BU. You will review and complete the forms listed below before Called to BU orientation or on your first day of work.  If you require assistance, please email askHR@baylor.edu . Information about each Form I-9 Complete section 1 of this form online , on or before your first day of work. If you cannot do so prior to your arrival in HR, you will have the opportunity to do so in the HR office at the end of Called to BU. NOTE: Please pay particular attention to the List of Acceptable Documents . Bring the required original, unexpired documents - either one item from list A or one item each from lists B AND C - with you to Called to BU in order to complete section 2. Failure to provide acceptable documents will affect your employment status. W-4 Inside of Ignite, use the detailed instructions of the form to complete this form on-line. Request for Deposit of Payroll Earnings Inside Ignite, complete this form on-line. Electronic W-2 Form Election Inside Ignite, complete this form online. Faculty Pay Option (For Faculty Only) Faculty have the option to receive their ten-month academic year salary in twelve installments. This form allows you to elect into this pay option. Self Identification Disclosure This form will be provided as a task inside of Ignite.  Read the form, complete as appropriate, then submit online through Ignite. Payroll Deduction Authorization Read this form then print for your initials and signature. Memorandum of Understanding Inside Ignite, please review each item listed on this form make sure you understand what is required of you. Copies of Unofficial Transcripts Unofficial transcripts are required for all positions requiring a degree, with the exception of Baylor transcripts or transcripts previously submitted to our office. Resources-Staff Employment Paperwork Details I-9 Acceptable Documents Baylor Human Resources Putting People First. Clifton Robinson Tower | Suite 200 700 S University Parks Dr Waco, TX 76706 One Bear Place #97053 Waco, TX 76798 askhr@baylor.edu 254-710-2000 Ask HR About Jobs Disclosures Visit Policies Human Resources Careers & Opportunities New Faculty and Staff New Employee Forms About Careers & Opportunities Back Research & Learn Back Staff Job Descriptions whyBaylor Apply & Interview Back Faculty Application Process Staff Application Process Veteran Resources for Interviewing New Faculty and Staff Back Welcome & Orientation Back Living in Waco Steps for New Faculty Back New Faculty Orientation Steps for New Staff New Employee Forms Back Completing Your I-9 Back FAQs for Completing Your I-9 Employment Forms by State Transition & Exit Back Exiting Faculty Exiting Staff Contingent Workers (Auxiliaries) Other Campus Employment Back Summer Camp Employment Visa Sponsorship and Support Back Hiring and Support of Internat