      "title": "Next Steps for International Scholars",
      "description": "Next Steps for International Scholars | Human Resources | Baylor University Skip to main content Skip to main navigation Open Mobile Navigation Human Resources About Careers & Opportunities Research & Learn Staff Job Descriptions whyBaylor Apply & Interview Faculty Application Process Staff Application Process Veteran Resources for Interviewing New Faculty and Staff Welcome & Orientation Steps for New Faculty Steps for New Staff New Employee Forms Employment Forms by State Transition & Exit Exiting Faculty Exiting Staff Contingent Workers (Auxiliaries) Other Campus Employment Summer Camp Employment Visa Sponsorship and Support Hiring and Support of International Scholars Next Steps for International Scholars Additional Resources Benefits & Advantages My Benefits Veteran Resources Baylor Wellbeing Enrollment Benefitfocus Information Benefitfocus Login 2026 Benefits Guide What's New for 2026 Retirement Investing in Your Retirement Preparing for Your Retirement Enjoying Your Retirement Retiree Advantages Retiree Benefits Overview Compensation Compensation Philosophy and Resources Total Compensation Statement Fair Labor Standards Act (FLSA) Merit Insurance Offerings Medical Insurance Plans Prescription Drug Plan Dental Insurance Plan Vision Insurance Plan Employer Provided Insurances Retiree Insurance Details Continuation of Insurance Coverage Voluntary Supplemental Insurances Pet Insurance Employee Recognition Tuition Remission Time Off & Leave Policies Family and Medical Leave Act (FMLA) Maternity and Primary Caregiver Leave Paid Caregiver Leave Paid Parental Leave Timecards During University Closures Employee Caregiver & Family Resources Adoption Assistance Program Crisis Resources Care.com Spousal Employment Assistance Educational Assistance Expectant & New Parents Progyny Surviving Spouse Benefits Baylor Advantages Athletic Tickets Baby Bear Program Baylor Bookstore Baylor Club at McLane Stadium Baylor Theatre Baylor Wellbeing BearStand Campus